[1] Zheng, Cheng et al. "Developing Differentiable Long-Range Force Field for Proteins with E (3) Neural Network Predicted Asymptotic Parameters." ChemRxiv. 2024; doi:10.26434/chemrxiv-2024-kkb5h.

[2] Alston J. Misquitta et al. "Ab initio atom–atom potentials using CamCASP: Theory
and application to many-body models for the pyridine dimer." Journal of chemical theory
and computation 2016, 12, 4184–4208.

[3] Tian Lu. et al. "A multifunctional wavefunction analyzer." Journal of computational chemistry 2012, 33, 580–592.